# taxiapp is a service, not a library with a published API surface: everything
# that is not private is exported. app.R and tests/testthat/helper-load.R
# attach the dependencies exactly as they did when the code was sourced file
# by file (ADR-0007).
#
# Deliberately no `import()` -- see ADR-0007: no roxygen here to generate
# them, and R CMD check is not part of the gate.
exportPattern("^[^\\.]")
